					<apex:panelGrid cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"> 
						<div class="Title" align="left">Fast, Painless CRM Implementations of On-Demand CRM</div>
						<br/>
						<div align="left">
						<p>
							Implementing a new <strong>on-demand CRM</strong> system is typically fast and painless with DCS. Unlike other Minnesota consulting firms, DCS has the CRM resources to quickly identify what's important and stage your CRM implementation to match what your organization can reasonably absorb at every phase. That means you get the fastest time to value with minimum disruptions. And our proven toolsets and repeatable processes shave even more time and money off the implementation processes. We make on-demand CRM simple with: 
						</p>
						<ul>
							<li><p>Our exclusive access to the <a href="http://demandchainsystems.force.com/dcs/CRMdiagnostic">CRM Diagnostic</a>, a sophisticated diagnostic tool that quickly and accurately measures your customer-facing capabilities and identifies the most important improvement initiatives. In as little as a day, DCS can help you focus your CRM resources on your weakest areas and improve customer relations quickly for a rapid ROI. </p></li>
							<li><p>Proven, repeatable processes for migrating your business to newer on-demand CRM systems, including templates and tools to quickly and accurately retrieve existing data and stage it to import cleanly into new systems.</p></li>
							<li><p>Our extensive experience and expertise with a variety of systems, from small home-grown tools to large relational repositories.
							</p></li>
							<li><p>Our close relationship and Select Partner status with Salesforce.com, the industry leader in CRM. We are <a href="http://demandchainsystems.force.com/dcs/sfdcExpertise">Salesforce.com's #1 partner in Minnesota</a> and can implement a customized Salesforce.com solution tailored to your business's unique requirements quickly and efficiently.</p></li>
						</ul>
						</div>
